=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"51.5\" width=\"320\" height=\"17.0\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,87.5 9.1,97.2 14.2,94.6 19.3,85.3 24.5,85.7 29.6,77.1 34.7,83.2 39.8,84.1 44.9,77.0 50.0,79.4 55.1,83.3 60.3,83.8 65.4,65.3 70.5,70.8 75.6,58.9 80.7,49.4 85.8,43.7 91.0,43.8 96.1,45.2 101.2,48.2 106.3,67.5 111.4,72.5 116.5,82.4 121.6,84.6 126.8,68.9 131.9,58.7 137.0,61.1 142.1,50.9 147.2,34.1 152.3,30.6 157.4,12.8 162.6,26.1 167.7,57.1 172.8,42.9 177.9,51.0 183.0,43.2 188.1,54.1 193.2,54.6 198.4,59.2 203.5,50.4 208.6,31.3 213.7,37.4 218.8,39.1 223.9,54.7 229.0,53.0 234.2,34.7 239.3,32.5 244.4,32.6 249.5,39.2 254.6,21.9 259.7,49.6 264.9,36.4 270.0,33.2 275.1,30.2 280.2,34.8 285.3,29.9 290.4,36.2 295.5,32.9 300.7,37.9 305.8,48.5 310.9,46.5 316.0,38.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 167.7 69.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 188.1 66.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 223.9 66.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 259.7 61.6 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"38.1\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http:/